				<wikidot:authorName>JakdragonX</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5588260</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:125%;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3476">SCP-3476 - A Place to Sever Stranded Heartstrings // Gabriel's Fountain</a></span></p> <p><em>&quot;The news of his death put a lot of baggage on my shoulders. How was I supposed to live up to the legacy of a self-made millionaire and owner of the biggest business in Oregon?&quot;</em></p> </div> <hr /> <p>A mysterious place within a lonely town of Oregon. Something has&#8230; changed it, made it something more than what it used to be. What happened? Why has it been abandoned? Come take a read and find out for yourself! (Please mind the Content Warning.)</p> <blockquote> <p><em>&quot;This&nbsp;is a delightfully disturbing real-feeling story.&quot;</em> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609287632" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><em>&quot;This is an excellent article, and one I hope we can use as the basis for all in-universe content warnings in the future.&quot;</em> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609287632" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span></p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
